{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"865913981406806046","name":"samuel-adams","position":59,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Now, you bring real hope to them boys out on the fort and in the skies. You're the real hero to Empire. Couldn't do it wif out ya.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:27:44.496000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869450968448786492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He smiles and does the polite oh no you're fine wave\n\n\"I appreciate your words, but it's everyone here and the people in with that inspire me. Everyday I wish I could do more to help our cause.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:29:20.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451372305715200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Nolan snaps out of his tired fugue state. “If we need food… I can cov-er this. Will be even.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:32:56.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869452276257943654","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I can-not im-a-gine be-ing off sol-id ground for weeks. Brav-er than I.” He says this to the halfwudgie","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:35:20.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869452882884329482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Nolan, I never got to ask about your life before all of this. What was it like? Do you have family and siblings?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:37:27.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453414143238184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“Mm… no sib-lings… that I know of. I grow up… in a cave. I have my moth-er for… first four years? And then… col-on-ists move in. My moth-er… fell in love with one.” He looks down at his drink. “Then she was gone.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:40:21.544000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454143738249256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I'm sorry to hear that. Who was the colonist? Did you keep a relationship with them?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:41:23.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454404451971103","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“You… mis-under-stand. I was… dif-fi-cult child. Cursed. So she left to col-o-ny with him. Had walls. I could not… go in. Or fol-low.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:43:32.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454943885623296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Ah. I'm sorry. I'm glad you're here with us now. Did I meet you in your other form? I know I saw you before the damnation but before that. I heard you sacrificed yourself to the ravens\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:45:26.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869455424422817842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I was… large. Ma-ny limbs. Sort of… in-sect and man. Could chirp like crick-et.” He smiles a bit, thinking about it. “I had Tab-u-la too, but they’re gone… no long-er need-ed me.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:48:43.023000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456247093620786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Oh, I'm sorry about that. That's pretty rude of them. But hey, you'll always be needed in my eyes. Not just for your abilities and work, but for your heart and compassion. You really care about people and their lives and it drives what you fight. Your drive inspires me too\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:51:38.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456985026879508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He looks surprised by this. “Thank you… I feel this about you as well. Not just… the char-is-ma that makes you stand out. You have a gol-den soul as well as voice. You al-ways try to… do the right thing.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:53:53.230000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869457548196069416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Sometimes. I'm not like you though. I have my limits, and when it comes to saving friends well, that's where my limits are pushed. I don't expect any redcoats listened to the surrender offer I gave them. And in the thick of it, if there's combat and 1 or 2 out of 5 surrender.. I don't think I'd let them live so long as at least 1 keeps threatening us\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:56:25.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869458188624334878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He chuckles humorlessly. “I have… been in-formed many time… re-cent-ly that this… will stab me… in the back la-ter. And I… I know this.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:58:10.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869458626853609513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Luckily that's why you keep friends around. You don't have to watch your back if you have a friend ready to do it for you\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:59:05.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869458857078964284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"And I have your back, just like I know you have mine\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:59:18.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869458913194573824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He gives a nod, smiling a little. “I will have your back as long… as I live. May-be beyond, even.” He takes a drink. “You are… quite a per-son… you know this? You draw ev-ery-one to you. And ev-ery-one feels as though… you are a dear friend. This is the im-pact you have on oth-ers. It am-azes me.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:02:43.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869459771206561852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
