{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He gets a look on his face of gratitude and a bit of a few tears in his eyes but he keeps it to a warm smile before drinking with his head tilted back to hide anything else","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:08:12.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869461152495706122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I am ver-y glad to have… met you, Finn Mi-dask.” He gives a little nod, like he’s said what he needed to say, before calmly taking another sip.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:11:39.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869462020133634078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I look forward to seeing what things we'll accomplish together in the future.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:12:38.489000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869462267874398268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"What are your plans once this whole thing ends and we're finally at peace again?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:13:04.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869462377035358268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I…” He gives a pause. “I like… Lamp-light-ing… but I am think-ing… I could… learn more heal-ing. Not just mag-ic, science too. Be-come a doctor. At the core… I wish to save peo-ple. Not fight, or ar-rest. To help… and heal.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:15:14.652000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869462922869506058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“What… a-bout you? Con-tin-ue your ra-di-o show? Or… some-thing new?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:16:08.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869463149525467197","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Probably get into helping build the city and make sure people have the right to speak and protest. As well as the radio. Although I've had an idea for moving illusion images that work remotely like my radio broadcasts do. Allow someone to see me and my work\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:20:10.082000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869464161992708126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“This is… ex-cell-ent ide-a!” He thinks for a second. “Im-a-gine… these im-ages… tell-ing stor-ies, myths, his-tor-ies!”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:22:17.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869464698322583573","reply_to_id":"869464161992708126","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"It could be used of course for the news, but with moving illusions stories of anything I wanted to show could be shared everywhere\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:23:26.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869464987654037524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“This… sounds ground-break-ing. I will…. in-vest in this… af-ter the war. Help make it ex-ist.” He smiles.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:24:51.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869465344304103455","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Haha I appreciate it. Unfortunately I had to sell all my stocks today to fund the jailbreak tomorrow\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:28:25.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869466239687356477","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“Should I… do the same? You can have funds… you will need it.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:29:28.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869466506063405137","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"No its alright, I think I should have just enough for what I'm going for\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:30:10.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869466678436712468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"(irl am still calculating exactly how many items I can get)","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:30:21.824000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869466727824654366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“I in…sist. The mon-ey will be lost… should I fall to-morr-ow. It should go to wor-thy cause.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:33:28.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869467509072478260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Fall tomorrow? You're one of the toughest people I've met! Honestly, go down there prepared with a Potion of invulnerability and there'll be no doubt you'll make it back\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:35:37.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869468051043672104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"And that's if you choose the violent option down there. You could find a way forward with peace. If anyone would find a way, you would.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:36:17.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869468218660622336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"His cheeks tinge a darker gray. “You have filled me with de-ter….min-a-tion. I will try… my best to save… every-one… my-self in-clu-ded.”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:40:33.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869469292540887081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I know you'll definitely try. But hey, know when to accept that you can't always save everyone, life doesn't allow it to always happen, but you can always at least put the effort in and try. If someone makes a decision and it likely means you and them would die if you stayed, value your life enough to save yourself\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:42:46.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869469849712222208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"The best course is usually the one that allows you the most options in the future\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:43:03.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869469923473252392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I can go back and help Eliza and Vivvy now because I ran then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:43:35.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869470058521452585","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
