{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Ben Franklin Comes out of the cottage with a picnic basket and a telescope.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:45:28.970000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869470532670750721","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Mr. Franklin! Been meaning to meet with you again. Haven't seen you since the Winter's ball some time ago. How is your latest project?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:46:38.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869470825823240233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Nolan hides his left hand, feeling suddenly self conscious in his choice in nail polish","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:47:20.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869470999530307644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Captain Finn! What good fortune running into you on this auspicious night!\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:47:55.046000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471145357893663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He uses a sextant to determine the orientation of his telescope.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:48:55.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471397506850817","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Finn looks at his contraption with interest","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:49:43.174000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471598879576084","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"And hello there, young man. Your stone face is quite ravishing in this moonlight.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:49:50.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471630043271198","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"His face turns a darker gray as his eyes widen. “Thank… you?”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:50:32.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471807470698496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"How do the stars fare, learn anything new from them? Or are your sights set on something else?\"\n\nHe says it playfully knowing full well of his personal life","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:50:34.650000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471814785577000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"The stars are showing their wonders tonight!\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:51:08.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869471955403808778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"In truth they aren't truly stars, rather bits of falling meteorite.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:51:56.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472158890471484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Long have I wished to obtain such a stone. Think of the marvels it may uncover if just a fragment made it to the ground.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:52:50.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472385898799115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He gestures to a rain of green glowing shooting stars.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:53:18.701000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472502865363005","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"High above the hudson.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:53:31.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472556925726790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Any thoughts on their properties?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:54:04.264000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472693970407445","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"“Green is… an un-us-ual col-or…”","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:54:47.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472875265019914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"A magnificent marvel!\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:55:10.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869472972522549259","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Green would be fortunate indeed. Such a rare metal would be worth double it's weight in platinum.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:55:43.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869473111718887475","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Any idea when they'll make contact with the water?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:56:48.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869473382142455840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"While it might not be wise to handle such a thing with bare skin, the weapons it could be forged into...\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:56:56.613000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869473416854528010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Within some hours. Though I'd not ask anyone to brave the Eldritch horrors of the Hudson.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:57:43.540000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T06:57:57.314000Z","id":"869473613680635905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
