{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They scratch the back of their head, an unsure smile growing as they're not entirely sure if that was good or bad. That's new, too. \"I did not. Have many. Prior engagements.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T19:54:40.303000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870031526421753876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They nod. \"I take it you are somewhat curious as to exactly what is going on? I am more than willing to answer questions, though most of them will have to wait until after I am... more secure in your trustworthiness.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T19:57:07.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870032142879563806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I would like. To know. Yes,\" they incline their head, a slightly confused cast to their features. Reading comprehension in Common was never their strong suit. \"What can you. Tell me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:00:54.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870033097159233636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Well, I can tell you for the moment that I represent a part of the rebellion, and that we would wish you to join us. ANything more than that i'll need to ask you some questions first.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T20:04:26.725000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870033986053873785","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
